"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2786,"###
 Muhammad bin Bashshar narrated to us, Muhammad bin Bakr narrated to us, Ibn Jurayj informed us, saying: 'Ata' said: Jabir bin Abdullah (RA) reported: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) arrived on the morning of the fourth day of Dhul-Hijjah. When we arrived, we were commanded to exit the state of Ihram (to make Halal). He said: ""Exit the state of Ihram and have relations with women."" 'Ata' said: Jabir said: He did"
